["Mo-Mo-Paradise 的「和牛饗宴」可說是原肉吃到飽中的高 CP 值之選。不分時段平日假日，含服務費1045的價格，就能無限享用比平常肉品等級明顯提升幾個檔次的澳洲和牛，和美國自然牛，對於講究cp值的人來說，絕對是值得一試的升級體驗。\n\n雖然這裡提供的澳洲和牛不若高級燒肉店日本和牛A4,A5那般入口即化、油花華麗，但肉質細緻度、油脂分佈與鮮嫩口感，仍遠勝一般吃到飽常見的牛五花或牛肩肉，並且澳洲和牛和美國自然牛還有一個好處，就是不像日本和牛那樣整體太油，其實很容易就吃膩了，根本吃不多。\n\n此外，MoMo 在配餐的誠意上也沒少給，例如有些分店附上的冷麵或三款一品料理，炙燒和牛壽司，都是無限量的，雖非主角，但依然看得出很有誠意。整體而言，Mo-Mo-Paradise 的和牛饗宴適合追求肉質升級又追求cp值的消費者。它不完美，卻穩定、誠實，對得起價格，肉也夠好吃。",null,[0,121]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/237880861467204881/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZRU3pSMFRHbFdhbUZ1T1hkblJSQUIQAQ%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/237880861467204881/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZRU3pSMFRHbFdhbUZ1T1hkblJSQUIQAQ%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/237880861467204881/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZRU3pSMFRHbFdhbUZ1T1hkblJSQUIQAQ%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/237880861467204881/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZRU3pSMFRHbFdhbUZ1T1hkblJSQUIQAQ%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/237880861467204881/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZRU3pSMFRHbFdhbUZ1T1hkblJSQUIQAQ%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/237880861467204881/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZRU3pSMFRHbFdhbUZ1T1hkblJSQUIQAQ%3D%3D"]],[null,null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/@/data\u003d!4m7!23m6!1m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VQSzR0TGlWamFuOXdnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xbecad6b3b8acb57f!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEPK4tLiVjan9wgE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VQSzR0TGlWamFuOXdnRRAB\u0026t\u003d3\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VQSzR0TGlWamFuOXdnRRItChZDSUhNMG9nS0VLTDVycG1Zc2R1M0JBEhNDZ3dJbW9HSXdRWVFrTnZ6NndJIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARf7WsuLPWyr4qCzBjN1YxUGhVRHFG\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwieu66hxdKWAxWRg68BHTAtAqMQoykIugIoBQ"],null,[null,[[1,1]]]],"0ahUKEwj46bihxdKWAxWyeV4EHV0vPP8Q0pMFCOQBKAg"],null,n